tender.description:
Repair of existing highways embankment showing signs of slope instability by excavating out failed materials and replacing with engineered fill at a gentler regraded slope of 1V:3H with counterfort drainage;
 Repair of existing culvert through installation of a CIPP lining (Contractor designed);
 10m extension of existing culvert with precast concrete box culvert (Contractor designed) to accommodate regraded slope;
 Construction of transition unit with manhole access at location where existing and extended culverts meet (Note: Manhole access chamber is to be Contractor designed);
 Construction of new outfall headwall (Contractor designed) with scour protection through installation of erosion control matting at outfall location;
 Widening of highway verges to 2m width on both sides of the highway with installation of verge marker posts and post and mesh fencing;
 Installation of highways surface water drainage system with direct outfalls to Coal Glen watercourse at northern inlet to existing culvert and to the transition unit between existing and extended culvert.

